OL,3,AHealey faces #35bn Budget challenge to
OL,4,Ameet spending pledges, says think tank
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is facing a
OL,7,Ffunding gap of up to #35bn and must set
OL,8,Fout "credible" spending plans in his
OL,9,Ffirst Budget on 28 October, an
OL,10,Finfluential think tank has warned.
OL,12,FThe Institute for Fiscal Studies (IFS)
OL,13,Fsaid that if the government wants to
OL,14,Fincrease defence spending to 3% of
OL,15,Fnational income by 2030 and lift health
OL,16,Fspending without squeezing other
OL,17,Fdepartments, it will need a "top-up" of
OL,18,Fbillions of pounds.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
